an 30s and for memory levels you have to get more than 12 hits.\nThe 3 best times of each level can put their name in local and online leaderboards. To win the game, you have yo get all the degrees of each level. Good luck!", "short_description": "An educational app to learn multiplication tables and the name of notes on the staff. Also, there are extra levels for ear training and a musical memory game. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/ab850223-262b-4a78-a7e1-94c7416d1aff", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rafael Gimeno", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.rafaelgimeno.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "184509411014193"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6393925397305632", "version": "4.5"}, "id": "754310422675817", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6393826977315474", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary"